    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668650/extras/e2634972e52e398225656215581624d5.webp?t=1567745525\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft bots and battle friends across 14 game modes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>+99 Ways To Customize Your Bot</strong></h2>From knights and dinosaurs, to bounty hunters and space warriors, choose among tons of different bots - each with cool ways to customize it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>14 Game Modes!</strong></h2>Hold the Flag, King of the Ring, Robo Bomb, Volleyhook, Baskethook, Hookball, Big Boss, Coin Collector, Team Deathmatch... - phew - and loooooooot more to challenge your friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the Community</strong></h2>We\u2019re indie devs &amp; gamers, and would love to include your ideas on Hookbots. Share\u2019em with us.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shields Will Be Broken<br>Jump In and Start Crushing Some Bots!</strong></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668650/extras/db32801b4f41e33db95d0eb366c4e278.avif?t=1567745525\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668650/extras/e2634972e52e398225656215581624d5.webp?t=1567745525\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft bots and battle friends across 14 game modes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>+99 Ways To Customize Your Bot</strong></h2>From knights and dinosaurs, to bounty hunters and space warriors, choose among tons of different bots - each with cool ways to customize it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>14 Game Modes!</strong></h2>Hold the Flag, King of the Ring, Robo Bomb, Volleyhook, Baskethook, Hookball, Big Boss, Coin Collector, Team Deathmatch... - phew - and loooooooot more to challenge your friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the Community</strong></h2>We\u2019re indie devs &amp; gamers, and would love to include your ideas on Hookbots. Share\u2019em with us.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shields Will Be Broken<br>Jump In and Start Crushing Some Bots!</strong></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668650/extras/db32801b4f41e33db95d0eb366c4e278.avif?t=1567745525\" /></div>",
